    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"One in every three Pakistanis is hypertensive and Pakistani children have higher mean blood pressure compared to the rest of the world,\" this was stated by Dr Seema Ameen Mohammad at a seminar held to mark the World Health Day on April 6. The seminar titled \"Family Medicine for All\" was organised by the Aga Khan University (AKU).",
